  "summary": "把一到 n 中不能被 m 整除的整数求和为 num1、能被 m 整除的整数求和为 num2，返回 num1-num2。",
  "insight": "一到 n 的总和等于 num1+num2，所以所求差值为总和减去两倍 num2。m 的倍数共有 floor(n/m) 个，其和可直接用等差数列公式计算。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "范围包含一和 n",
    "差值可能为负数",
    "整除组需要在总和中扣除两次",
    "倍数个数使用整数除法"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-series-closed-form",
      "title": "等差数列闭式计算",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "分别用公式得到总和与倍数和。",
      "steps": [
        "count=n/m",
        "total=n*(n+1)/2",
        "divisible=m*count*(count+1)/2",
        "返回 total-2*divisible"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(1)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/arithmetic-series-closed-form/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/arithmetic-series-closed-form/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/arithmetic-series-closed-form/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
